            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention recognizes that there is a long felt need for more efficient platforms, networks, systems, and methods in the conveyance industry for goods and services. A first aspect of the present invention generally relates to a system in the conveyance and other industries. A second aspect of the present invention generally relates to a method of use of the interactive system of the present invention.</p>
